he would not kneel, and would not stop walking. The 251st year.","text_zh":"一块雕成朝圣者跪姿的石头。盐海岸的伊索尔德，朝圣者。她不肯下跪，也不肯停下脚步。持冠第二百五十一年。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~4","type":"fixture/sacred/gravestone","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":31,"y":7},"name":{"en":"A kneeling stone","zh":"跪石"},"props":{"text":"A stone carved as a pilgrim kneeling. Unnamed. A scallop and a child's shoe.","text_zh":"一块雕成朝圣者跪姿的石头。无名。一枚扇贝，一只孩子的鞋。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~5","type":"fixture/sacred/gravestone","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":10,"y":17},"name":{"en":"A kneeling stone","zh":"跪石"},"props":{"text":"A stone carved as a pilgrim kneeling. Odile the Smith, pilgrim. She would not kneel. The 263rd year.","text_zh":"一块雕成朝圣者跪姿的石头。铁匠奥迪尔，朝圣者。她不肯下跪。持冠第二百六十三年。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~6","type":"fixture/sacred/gravestone","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":17,"y":17},"name":{"en":"A kneeling stone","zh":"跪石"},"props":{"text":"A stone carved as a pilgrim kneeling. Corin, pilgrim, sent with the blessing of the Holy See. He would not kneel. The 270th year.","text_zh":"一块雕成朝圣者跪姿的石头。科林，朝圣者，奉圣座祝福而来。他不肯下跪。持冠第二百七十年。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~7","type":"fixture/sacred/gravestone","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":24,"y":17},"name":{"en":"A kneeling stone","zh":"跪石"},"props":{"text":"A stone carved as a pilgrim kneeling. Petra and Joan, pilgrims, sisters. Neither would kneel.","text_zh":"一块雕成朝圣者跪姿的石头。佩特拉与琼，朝圣者，姐妹。两人都不肯下跪。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~8","type":"fixture/sacred/gravestone","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":31,"y":17},"name":{"en":"A kneeling stone","zh":"跪石"},"props":{"text":"A stone carved as a pilgrim kneeling. The latest stone. The carving is fresh. The name is not cut yet.","text_zh":"一块雕成朝圣者跪姿的石头。最新的一块石头。刻痕还很新。名字还没刻上。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~9","type":"fixture/scarecrow","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":16,"y":9},"name":{"en":"A kneeling subject","zh":"跪着的\"臣民\""},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"A pilgrim's coat stuffed with straw, bent at the knees and tied there with briar. It faces east, in a row with the others. The briar is still green.","text_zh":"一件塞满稻草的朝圣者外衣，膝盖处弯折，用荆棘捆着。它和别的稻草人排成一行，脸朝东方。捆它的荆棘还是绿的。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~a","type":"fixture/scarecrow","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":18,"y":9},"name":{"en":"A kneeling subject","zh":"跪着的\"臣民\""},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"A pilgrim's coat stuffed with straw, bent at the knees and tied there with briar. It faces east, in a row with the others. The briar is still green.","text_zh":"一件塞满稻草的朝圣者外衣，膝盖处弯折，用荆棘捆着。它和别的稻草人排成一行，脸朝东方。捆它的荆棘还是绿的。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~b","type":"fixture/scarecrow","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":20,"y":9},"name":{"en":"A kneeling subject","zh":"跪着的\"臣民\""},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"A pilgrim's coat stuffed with straw, bent at the knees and tied there with briar. It faces east, in a row with the others. The briar is still green.","text_zh":"一件塞满稻草的朝圣者外衣，膝盖处弯折，用荆棘捆着。它和别的稻草人排成一行，脸朝东方。捆它的荆棘还是绿的。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~c","type":"fixture/scarecrow","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":26,"y":15},"name":{"en":"A kneeling subject","zh":"跪着的\"臣民\""},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"A pilgrim's coat stuffed with straw, bent at the knees and tied there with briar. It faces east, in a row with the others. The briar is still green.","text_zh":"一件塞满稻草的朝圣者外衣，膝盖处弯折，用荆棘捆着。它和别的稻草人排成一行，脸朝东方。捆它的荆棘还是绿的。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~d","type":"fixture/scarecrow","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":28,"y":15},"name":{"en":"A kneeling subject","zh":"跪着的\"臣民\""},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"A pilgrim's coat stuffed with straw, bent at the knees and tied there with briar. It faces east, in a row with the others. The briar is still green.","text_zh":"一件塞满稻草的朝圣者外衣，膝盖处弯折，用荆棘捆着。它和别的稻草人排成一行，脸朝东方。捆它的荆棘还是绿的。"}},{"id":"kneelfield~e","type":"fixture/scarecrow","place":{"on":"tile","map":"kneelfield","x":30,"y":15},"name":{"en":"A kneeling subject","zh":"跪着的\"臣民\""},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"A pilgrim's coat st